      "summary": null,
      "review_markdown": "The refactor cleanly separates the idle preview panel from the shared canvas frame, and the new alignment parameter preserves the gallery's centered behavior while fixing the idle panel's vertical positioning. I did not find any discrete regression or correctness issue introduced by the patch.\n",
      "head_commit_message": null
    },
