      "review_markdown": "The patch removes the only definitions of `ProjectListPanel` and `PromptDataPanel` while the view still instantiates them, which will fail compilation. It also drops the UI that displays the generated advised-channel list, so the AI marketing advisor no longer shows its results.\n\nFull review comments:\n\n- [P0] Restore the hidden panel widgets before using them — C:/actions-runner/_work/promeo-pc-promeo/promeo-pc-promeo/promeo_trunk/lib/src/view/magic_designer/ai_marketing_advisor/ai_marketing_advisor_widget.dart:2279-2330\n  `ProjectListPanel` and `PromptDataPanel` are still instantiated in `lib/src/view/magic_designer/ai_marketing_advisor/ai_marketing_advisor_view.dart:4991-4994`, but this patch comments out their only definitions here (`ai_marketing_advisor_widget.dart:2279-2330`). That leaves unresolved identifiers and will break Dart compilation the first time the workspace view is built.\n\n- [P1] Keep rendering the advised channel results after generation — C:/actions-runner/_work/promeo-pc-promeo/promeo-pc-promeo/promeo_trunk/lib/src/view/magic_designer/ai_marketing_advisor/ai_marketing_advisor_view.dart:4753-4779\n  `buildAdvicedMarketingChannelSection()` still watches `advicedMktChannelListProvider`, but the stack that rendered `buildAdvicedMarketingChannelResultList()` was removed in `ai_marketing_advisor_view.dart:4753-4779`. In the normal post-generation case, the spinner disappears and the generated marketing-channel recommendations are never shown, so this feature no longer surfaces its output.\n",
      "head_commit_message": null
    },
